<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GPL Mods Support Desk & AI Debugger</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@lottiefiles/lottie-player@latest/dist/lottie-player.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root { 
            --bg: #0a0a0a; 
            --panel: #1a1a1a; 
            --text: #f5f5f5; 
            --gold: #FFD700; 
            --silver: #c0c0c0; 
            --border: #333; 
            --blue: #2196F3; 
            --green: #2ecc71;
            --red: #e74c3c;
            --orange: #f39c12;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
        
        /* Sidebar (Chat List & Diagnostics) */
        .sidebar { width: 380px; min-width: 320px; background: var(--panel); border-right: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .sidebar-header { padding: 18px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .sidebar-header h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.3em; }
        
        /* Live Stats Pill Bar */
        .stats-bar { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 18px; background: #141414; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .stat-pill { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #202020; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.8em; border: 1px solid #333; }
        
        /* AI Debugger Card */
        .ai-debugger-card {
            margin: 12px 16px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: #121212;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--green);
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        .ai-debugger-card.offline {
            border-left-color: var(--red);
        }
        .ai-debugger-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .ai-status-indicator {
            width: 9px;
            height: 9px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .ai-status-indicator.offline {
            background: var(--red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--red);
        }
        .ping-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15);
            color: var(--gold);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.72em;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .ping-btn:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--bg); }
        .ai-meta-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4px 10px;
            font-size: 0.78em;
            color: var(--silver);
        }
        .ai-meta-grid b { color: var(--white); }
        .ai-error-box {
            margin-top: 8px;
            padding: 8px;
            background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.4);
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #ffadad;
            font-size: 0.74em;
            word-break: break-all;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .ai-ping-box {
            margin-top: 6px;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            background: #1c1c1c;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.75em;
            color: var(--gold);
            display: none;
        }

        .chat-list { flex-grow: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 10px 14px; }
        .queue-section-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 8px 10px; margin: 10px 0 6px; font-size: 0.76em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; border-radius: 6px; }
        .queue-section-header.priority { color: var(--gold); background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
        .queue-section-header.standard { color: var(--silver); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border-left: 3px solid #555; }
        .queue-count { font-size: 0.85em; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: bold; }
        .queue-count.priority { background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2); color: var(--gold); }
        .queue-count.standard { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: var(--silver); }

        .chat-item { padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 10px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; background: var(--bg); position: relative; }
        .chat-item:hover, .chat-item.active { border-color: var(--gold); }
        .chat-item.priority-item { border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.45); background: linear-gradient(145deg, #161408 0%, #0d0d0d 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.05); }
        .chat-item.priority-item:hover, .chat-item.priority-item.active { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2); }
        
        .chat-item .status { font-size: 0.72em; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; float: right; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .chat-item .status.waiting { background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.2); color: #ffadad; border: 1px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.4); }
        .chat-item .status.active { background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.2); color: #b0ffb0; border: 1px solid rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.4); }
        
        .user-tag-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 0.7em; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 6px; }
        .tag-priority { background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15); color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3); }
        .tag-distributor { background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.15); color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.3); }
        
        /* Main Chat Window */
        .main-chat { flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg); position: relative; }
        .chat-header { padding: 16px 25px; background: var(--panel); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .chat-header .device-info { font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--silver); margin-top: 5px; }
        
        .chat-messages { flex-grow: 1; padding: 25px; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; background: #0e0e0e; }
        .msg-bubble { max-width: 70%; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.95em; word-wrap: break-word; animation: supportMessageIn .22s ease-out; }
        @keyframes supportMessageIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px) scale(.98); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }
        .msg-user { align-self: flex-start; background: #222; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom-left-radius: 0; color: var(--text); }
        .msg-agent { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-bottom-right-radius: 0; }
        .msg-bot { align-self: flex-start; background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08); border: 1px solid var(--gold); color: var(--gold); border-bottom-left-radius: 0; }
        .msg-system { align-self: center; background: transparent; color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.85em; font-style: italic; border: 1px dashed #444; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
        
        .chat-input-area { padding: 15px 25px; background: var(--panel); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; position: relative; }
        .chat-tool-btn { background: #252525; border: 1px solid #444; color: var(--silver); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 15px; font-size: 1.1em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .chat-tool-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); background: #2c2c2c; transform: scale(1.05); }
        .chat-tool-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
        
        .chat-input-area input { flex-grow: 1; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); outline: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.95em; }
        .chat-input-area input:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
        .chat-input-area button.submit-btn { padding: 14px 25px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; background: var(--gold); color: var(--bg); font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .chat-input-area button.submit-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { filter: brightness(1.1); transform: scale(1.02); }
        .chat-input-area button.submit-btn:disabled { background: #555; cursor: not-allowed; }
        
        /* Floating Emoji Picker Popover */
        .emoji-picker-popover { position: absolute; bottom: 75px; left: 25px; width: 320px; background: #181818; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); z-index: 1000; padding: 12px; display: none; }
        .emoji-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr); gap: 6px; max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 4px; }
        .emoji-item { font-size: 1.35em; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px; transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s; user-select: none; }
        .emoji-item:hover { background: #2a2a2a; transform: scale(1.2); }
        
        /* Media Attachment Tray */
        .media-tray { display: none; padding: 8px 25px; background: #151515; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); gap: 10px; align-items: center; overflow-x: auto; }
        .media-tray-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #444; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--gold); }
        .media-tray-item .remove-media-btn { color: var(--red); cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 1.1em; padding: 0 2px; }
        
        #empty-state { flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--silver); font-size: 1.1em; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }

        /* Mobile Responsive Enhancements */
        .mobile-back-btn {
            display: none;
            background: #252525;
            color: var(--gold);
            border: 1px solid #444;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .mobile-back-btn:hover { background: #333; }

        .ai-collapse-toggle {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--silver);
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 4px 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .ai-debugger-card.collapsed .ai-debugger-body {
            display: none !important;
        }
        .ai-debugger-card.collapsed {
            padding: 8px 12px;
        }
        .ai-debugger-card.collapsed .ai-collapse-toggle i {
            transform: rotate(-90deg);
        }

        /* Staff Work Email Card */
        .staff-email-card {
            margin: 0 16px 10px 16px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: #121212;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .staff-email-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .staff-email-card:not(.collapsed) .staff-email-header {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .staff-email-toggle {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--silver);
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 4px 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .staff-email-card.collapsed .staff-email-body {
            display: none !important;
        }
        .staff-email-card.collapsed {
            padding: 8px 12px;
        }
        .staff-email-card.collapsed .staff-email-toggle i {
            transform: rotate(-90deg);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                flex-direction: column;
                height: 100dvh;
                height: 100vh;
                position: relative;
            }
            .sidebar {
                width: 100% !important;
                min-width: 0 !important;
                height: 100%;
                border-right: none;
            }
            .main-chat {
                width: 100% !important;
                height: 100%;
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                z-index: 100;
            }
            #empty-state {
                display: none !important;
            }
            body:not(.chat-view-active) .main-chat {
                display: none !important;
            }
            body.chat-view-active .sidebar {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .mobile-back-btn {
                display: inline-flex !important;
            }
            .chat-header {
                padding: 10px 14px;
                gap: 8px;
                flex-wrap: nowrap;
            }
            .chat-header h3 {
                font-size: 1em;
            }
            .chat-header .device-info {
                font-size: 0.72em;
            }
            .chat-messages {
                padding: 12px;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            .msg-bubble {
                max-width: 88%;
                padding: 10px 13px;
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }
            .chat-input-area {
                padding: 10px 12px;
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .chat-input-area input {
                padding: 11px 12px;
                font-size: 16px; /* Prevents auto-zoom on iOS */
            }
            .chat-tool-btn {
                padding: 10px 11px;
                font-size: 1em;
            }
            .chat-input-area button.submit-btn {
                padding: 11px 16px;
            }
            .emoji-picker-popover {
                width: calc(100% - 24px) !important;
                left: 12px !important;
                right: 12px !important;
                max-width: 360px;
                bottom: 68px;
            }
            .stats-bar {
                padding: 8px 14px;
            }
            .stat-pill {
                padding: 5px 8px;
                font-size: 0.75em;
            }
            .sidebar-header {
                padding: 14px 16px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .chat-header {
                padding: 8px 10px;
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .chat-header .chat-header-actions {
                gap: 4px !important;
            }
            #emailCustomerBtn {
                padding: 6px 9px !important;
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
            #claimBtn {
                padding: 6px 10px !important;
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
            #transferToGeminiBtn {
                padding: 6px 9px !important;
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
            #transferToGeminiBtn span {
                display: none;
            }
            #deleteChatBtn {
                padding: 6px 9px !important;
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
            .media-tray {
                padding: 6px 12px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <a href="/admin" class="dynamic-back-btn" style="padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 0.85em; display: inline-flex;">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> AdminJS
                </a>
            </div>
            <h2>Support Desk</h2>
            <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--silver);">Agent: <%= user.username %></p>
            <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--green); border-radius: 6px; color: #a3e9b8; font-size: 0.8em; line-height: 1.4; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: var(--green); margin-top: 2px;"></i>
                    <div style="word-break: break-word;"><%= success %></div>
                </div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--red); border-radius: 6px; color: #ffadad; font-size: 0.8em; line-height: 1.4; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle" style="color: var(--red); margin-top: 2px;"></i>
                    <div style="word-break: break-word;"><%= error %></div>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>

        <!-- Live Members & Agents Bar -->
        <div class="stats-bar">
            <div class="stat-pill" title="Connected Support Agents">
                <i class="fas fa-headset" style="color:var(--green);"></i>
                <span>Agents: <b id="statAgents">1</b></span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-pill" title="Live Users on Support Chat">
                <i class="fas fa-users" style="color:var(--blue);"></i>
                <span>Members: <b id="statMembers">1</b></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- AI Engine Diagnostics & Debugger Card -->
        <div class="ai-debugger-card" id="aiDebuggerCard">
            <div class="ai-debugger-header" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="toggleAiDebugger()">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
                    <span class="ai-status-indicator" id="aiStatusDot"></span>
                    <strong style="font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--white);">Gemini 3.6 Flash AI</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                    <button type="button" class="ping-btn" id="pingAiBtn" onclick="event.stopPropagation()" title="Ping AI and test API connectivity">
                        <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> <span id="pingBtnText">Ping AI</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="ai-collapse-toggle" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleAiDebugger();" title="Toggle AI Panel">
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-debugger-body" id="aiDebuggerBody">
                <div class="ai-meta-grid">
                    <span>Status: <b id="aiStatusLabel">Online</b></span>
                    <span>Latency: <b id="aiLatencyLabel">--</b></span>
                    <span>Requests: <b id="aiReqsLabel">0</b></span>
                    <span>Errors: <b id="aiErrorsLabel" style="color: #ffadad;">0</b></span>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-error-box" id="aiErrorBox" style="display: none;">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle" style="margin-top: 2px;"></i>
                    <span id="aiErrorText">No errors reported</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-ping-box" id="aiPingBox"></div>
                
                <!-- Gemini Page Visibility Button -->
                <button type="button" id="openGeminiModalBtn" style="margin-top: 10px; width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.35); border-radius: 6px; color: #64b5f6; font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.2s;">
                    <i class="fas fa-eye-slash"></i> Configure Gemini Visibility
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Staff Work Email & SMTP Card -->
        <div class="staff-email-card" id="staffEmailCard">
            <div class="staff-email-header" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="toggleStaffEmailCard()">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-width: 0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text" style="color: var(--blue); font-size: 0.95em;"></i>
                    <strong style="font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--white); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Staff Work Email</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <% if (user.customEmailAlias) { %>
                        <span style="font-size: 0.68em; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.18); color: #7bed9f; border: 1px solid rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.4); font-weight: bold;">Active</span>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <span style="font-size: 0.68em; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.18); color: #64b5f6; border: 1px solid rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.4); font-weight: bold;">Unclaimed</span>
                    <% } %>
                    <button type="button" class="staff-email-toggle" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleStaffEmailCard();" title="Toggle Staff Email Panel">
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="staff-email-body" id="staffEmailBody">
                <% const deskDomain = (typeof domain !== 'undefined' && domain) ? domain : 'gplmods.webredirect.org'; %>
                <% if (!user.customEmailAlias) { %>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.78em; color: var(--silver); line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                        Claim your official staff email. Inbound messages automatically forward to <strong style="color: var(--white);"><%= user.email %></strong>.
                    </div>
                    <% const previewAlias = user.username.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, ''); %>
                    <div style="background: #0a0a0a; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px dashed var(--blue); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all;">
                        <%= previewAlias %>@<%= deskDomain %>
                    </div>
                    <form id="deskClaimEmailForm" action="/account/claim-custom-email" method="POST">
                        <input type="hidden" name="redirectUrl" value="/admin/support">
                        <button type="submit" id="deskClaimBtn" style="width: 100%; padding: 7px 10px; background: var(--blue); border: none; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; transition: 0.2s;">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Claim Staff Email
                        </button>
                    </form>
                <% } else { %>
                    <div style="background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3); padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px;">
                        <div style="min-width: 0; overflow: hidden;">
                            <div style="color: var(--green); font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.82em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">
                                <%= user.customEmailAlias %>@<%= deskDomain %>
                            </div>
                            <div style="color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.7em; margin-top: 2px;">
                                Forwards to: <%= user.email %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" onclick="copyStaffEmail('<%= user.customEmailAlias %>@<%= deskDomain %>', this)" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--silver); padding: 3px 6px; font-size: 0.72em; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;" title="Copy email address">
                            <i class="fas fa-copy"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <% if (!user.hasSmtpAccess) { %>
                        <div style="font-size: 0.74em; color: var(--silver); line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            Generate SMTP credentials to send official emails from your client (Gmail, Outlook).
                        </div>
                        <form id="deskGenSmtpForm" action="/account/generate-smtp" method="POST">
                            <input type="hidden" name="redirectUrl" value="/admin/support">
                            <button type="submit" id="deskGenSmtpBtn" style="width: 100%; padding: 6px 10px; background: rgba(255,215,0,0.12); border: 1px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 6px; color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.78em; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; transition: 0.2s;">
                                <i class="fas fa-key"></i> Generate SMTP Access
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div style="background: #0c0c0c; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 7px 9px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                <span style="font-size: 0.72em; color: var(--green); font-weight: bold;"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> SMTP Ready</span>
                                <span style="font-size: 0.68em; color: var(--silver);">Port 587 (TLS)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #888; font-family: monospace; line-height: 1.4;">
                                Host: smtp.improvmx.com<br>
                                User: <%= user.customEmailAlias %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <form id="deskGenSmtpForm" action="/account/generate-smtp" method="POST" onsubmit="return confirm('Regenerating will invalidate previous SMTP password. Continue?');">
                            <input type="hidden" name="redirectUrl" value="/admin/support">
                            <button type="submit" id="deskGenSmtpBtn" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px 8px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #3a3a3a; border-radius: 5px; color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.74em; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; transition: 0.2s;">
                                <i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Regenerate Password
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    <% } %>
                <% } %>
                <div id="staffEmailFeedbackBox" style="display: none; margin-top: 8px; padding: 7px 9px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.75em;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="padding: 0 16px; margin-top: 5px;">
            <span style="font-size: 0.75em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--silver); font-weight: bold;">Conversations</span>
        </div>

        <div class="chat-list" id="chatList">
            <!-- Chats populated here via JS -->
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-chat" id="mainChat" style="display: none;">
        <div class="chat-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 0;">
                <button type="button" class="mobile-back-btn" id="mobileBackBtn" onclick="closeMobileChat()" title="Back to chat list">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
                </button>
                <div style="min-width: 0;">
                    <h3 id="chatHeaderName" style="margin: 0; color: var(--white); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">User Name</h3>
                    <div id="chatHeaderInfo" class="device-info" style="white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Guest | No Device Info</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                <a id="emailCustomerBtn" href="#" style="padding: 9px 14px; background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--blue); color: #64b5f6; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.85em; display: none; align-items: center; gap: 6px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;" title="Send email to customer">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> <span>Email</span>
                </a>
                <button id="claimBtn" style="padding: 9px 16px; background: var(--green); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.85em; display: none;">
                    <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-hand" style="margin-right: 4px;"></i> Claim
                </button>
                <button id="transferToGeminiBtn" type="button" style="padding: 9px 14px; background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.4); color: #00e676; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85em; display: none; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.2s;" title="Resolve issue and transfer user back to Gemini AI">
                    <img src="/images/gemini.png" alt="Gemini" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 4px; object-fit: contain;"> <span>Transfer to Gemini</span>
                </button>
                <button id="deleteChatBtn" type="button" title="Delete conversation permanently" style="padding: 9px 12px; background: transparent; color: var(--red); border: 1px solid var(--red); border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.85em;"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i></button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="chat-messages" id="chatMessages"></div>
        
        <!-- Media Tray for uploaded images/videos before sending -->
        <div class="media-tray" id="deskMediaTray"></div>

        <form class="chat-input-area" id="agentForm">
            <!-- Emoji Toggle Button -->
            <button type="button" class="chat-tool-btn" id="deskEmojiToggleBtn" title="Insert Emoji" disabled>
                <i class="far fa-smile"></i>
            </button>

            <!-- Attachment Button -->
            <button type="button" class="chat-tool-btn" id="deskMediaUploadBtn" title="Upload Image or Video" disabled>
                <i class="fas fa-paperclip"></i>
            </button>
            <input type="file" id="deskMediaInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,video/mp4,video/webm,video/quicktime" style="display: none;">

            <!-- Emoji Picker Popover -->
            <div class="emoji-picker-popover" id="deskEmojiPopover">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.75em; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Emojis</span>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.7em; color: var(--silver); cursor: pointer;" id="closeDeskEmojiBtn">&times; Close</span>
                </div>
                <div class="emoji-grid" id="deskEmojiGrid">
                    <!-- Emojis populated by JS -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <input type="text" id="agentInput" placeholder="Type a reply..." autocomplete="off" disabled>
            <button type="submit" id="agentSubmit" class="submit-btn" disabled><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i></button>
        </form>
    </div>
    
    <div id="empty-state" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px;">
        <lottie-player src="/animations/ticket.json" background="transparent" speed="1" style="width: 140px; height: 140px; margin-bottom: 15px; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(0, 176, 255, 0.35));" loop autoplay></lottie-player>
        <h3 style="color: var(--white); font-size: 1.15em; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">No Active Conversation Selected</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0; max-width: 320px; line-height: 1.5;">Select a chat or ticket inquiry from the sidebar to inspect diagnostics and respond.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="deleteChatModal" class="policy-modal" style="display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:9999; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.7); opacity:0; transition:opacity .2s ease;">
        <div style="background-color:var(--panel); color:var(--white); padding:30px; text-align:center; border-radius:15px; max-width:450px; width:90%; border-top:3px solid var(--red); box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5);">
            <h2 style="color:var(--red); margin:0 0 15px;">Delete conversation?</h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 20px; color:var(--silver); line-height:1.6;">This permanently deletes the selected chat and cannot be undone.</p>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:15px; justify-content:center;"><button type="button" id="confirmDeleteChatBtn" style="background:var(--red); color:var(--white); padding:10px 25px; border-radius:20px; font-weight:bold; border:0; cursor:pointer;">Yes, Delete</button><button type="button" id="cancelDeleteChatBtn" style="background:transparent; color:var(--silver); border:2px solid var(--silver); padding:10px 25px; border-radius:20px; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer;">Cancel</button></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Confirmation Modal for Agent Transfer to Gemini AI Assistant -->
    <div id="deskGeminiTransferModal" class="policy-modal" style="display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:9999; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.78); opacity:0; transition:opacity .2s ease; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1b2230 0%, #11141c 50%, #0a0c12 100%); color:var(--white); padding:30px 24px; text-align:center; border-radius:16px; max-width:440px; width:92%; border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.45); box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.85), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 176, 255, 0.25);">
            <div style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 176, 255, 0.2), rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.15)); border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 14px auto; box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.35); position: relative;">
                <img src="/images/gemini.png" alt="Gemini AI" style="width: 34px; height: 34px; object-fit: contain;">
                <span style="position: absolute; bottom: -3px; right: -3px; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00e676; border: 2px solid #11141c; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e676;"></span>
            </div>
            <h2 style="color:var(--white); font-size: 1.25em; margin:0 0 10px; font-weight: 700;">Transfer to Gemini AI?</h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 22px; color:var(--silver); font-size: 0.88em; line-height:1.6;">
                Are you sure you want to mark this issue as resolved and hand the customer back to Gemini AI Assistant?
            </p>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center;">
                <button type="button" id="cancelDeskGeminiBtn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color:#ccc; border:1.5px solid #3d4250; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:600; font-size: 0.88em; cursor:pointer; transition: all 0.2s;">
                    Keep Chat
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="confirmDeskGeminiBtn" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #00e676 0%, #00b0ff 100%); color:#000; padding:10px 22px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:700; font-size: 0.88em; border:0; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.4); transition: all 0.2s;">
                    <i class="fas fa-robot" style="margin-right: 5px;"></i> Transfer to Gemini
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
    <script>
        const socket = io();
        const agentId = '<%= user._id %>';
        const agentName = '<%= user.username %>';
        
        let activeChats = [];
        let currentSessionId = null;

        // UI Elements
        const chatListEl = document.getElementById('chatList');
        const mainChatEl = document.getElementById('mainChat');
        const emptyStateEl = document.getElementById('empty-state');
        const chatMessagesEl = document.getElementById('chatMessages');
        const chatHeaderName = document.getElementById('chatHeaderName');
        const chatHeaderInfo = document.getElementById('chatHeaderInfo');
        const claimBtn = document.getElementById('claimBtn');
        const deleteChatBtn = document.getElementById('deleteChatBtn');
        const deleteChatModal = document.getElementById('deleteChatModal');
        const confirmDeleteChatBtn = document.getElementById('confirmDeleteChatBtn');
        const cancelDeleteChatBtn = document.getElementById('cancelDeleteChatBtn');
        const agentInput = document.getElementById('agentInput');
        const agentSubmit = document.getElementById('agentSubmit');
        const deskMediaTray = document.getElementById('deskMediaTray');
        const deskEmojiToggleBtn = document.getElementById('deskEmojiToggleBtn');
        const deskMediaUploadBtn = document.getElementById('deskMediaUploadBtn');
        const deskMediaInput = document.getElementById('deskMediaInput');
        const deskEmojiPopover = document.getElementById('deskEmojiPopover');
        const deskEmojiGrid = document.getElementById('deskEmojiGrid');
        const closeDeskEmojiBtn = document.getElementById('closeDeskEmojiBtn');
        let pendingUploadedMedia = [];

        // Diagnostics Elements
        const statAgents = document.getElementById('statAgents');
        const statMembers = document.getElementById('statMembers');
        const aiDebuggerCard = document.getElementById('aiDebuggerCard');
        const aiStatusDot = document.getElementById('aiStatusDot');
        const aiStatusLabel = document.getElementById('aiStatusLabel');
        const aiLatencyLabel = document.getElementById('aiLatencyLabel');
        const aiReqsLabel = document.getElementById('aiReqsLabel');
        const aiErrorsLabel = document.getElementById('aiErrorsLabel');
        const aiErrorBox = document.getElementById('aiErrorBox');
        const aiErrorText = document.getElementById('aiErrorText');
        const aiPingBox = document.getElementById('aiPingBox');
        const pingAiBtn = document.getElementById('pingAiBtn');
        const pingBtnText = document.getElementById('pingBtnText');

        // 1. Connect as Agent
        socket.emit('agent_join', { agentId });

        // 2. Load Initial Chats
        socket.on('load_active_chats', (chats) => {
            activeChats = chats;
            renderChatList();
        });

        // 3. Receive Live Stats Update (Online Members & AI Health)
        socket.on('support_stats_update', (stats) => {
            if (statAgents) statAgents.textContent = stats.agentsOnline || 0;
            if (statMembers) statMembers.textContent = stats.membersOnline || 0;
            if (stats.aiStatus) updateAiDiagnosticsUI(stats.aiStatus);
        });

        socket.on('ai_status_update', (aiStatus) => {
            updateAiDiagnosticsUI(aiStatus);
        });

        function updateAiDiagnosticsUI(status) {
            const isOnline = status.status === 'online';
            aiStatusLabel.textContent = isOnline ? 'Online' : 'Offline';
            aiStatusLabel.style.color = isOnline ? 'var(--green)' : 'var(--red)';
            
            if (isOnline) {
                aiStatusDot.className = 'ai-status-indicator';
                aiDebuggerCard.className = 'ai-debugger-card';
            } else {
                aiStatusDot.className = 'ai-status-indicator offline';
                aiDebuggerCard.className = 'ai-debugger-card offline';
            }

            aiLatencyLabel.textContent = status.latencyMs ? `${status.latencyMs}ms` : '--';
            aiReqsLabel.textContent = status.totalRequests || 0;
            aiErrorsLabel.textContent = status.totalErrors || 0;

            if (status.lastError) {
                aiErrorBox.style.display = 'flex';
                aiErrorText.textContent = `${status.lastError.message || 'Unknown error'}`;
            } else {
                aiErrorBox.style.display = 'none';
            }
        }

        // 4. Ping AI Debugger
        pingAiBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            pingBtnText.textContent = 'Testing...';
            pingAiBtn.disabled = true;
            aiPingBox.style.display = 'block';
            aiPingBox.textContent = 'Sending ping to Gemini 3.6 Flash...';
            socket.emit('test_ai_connection');
        });

        socket.on('ai_debug_result', (result) => {
            pingBtnText.textContent = 'Ping AI';
            pingAiBtn.disabled = false;
            aiPingBox.style.display = 'block';
            if (result.success) {
                aiPingBox.innerHTML = `<span style="color:var(--green); font-weight:bold;">✔ Ping Success (${result.latencyMs}ms)</span><br>${result.response}`;
            } else {
                aiPingBox.innerHTML = `<span style="color:var(--red); font-weight:bold;">✖ Ping Failed (${result.latencyMs}ms)</span><br>${result.error}`;
            }
            if (result.status) updateAiDiagnosticsUI(result.status);
        });

        // 5. Receive New Chat Alert
        socket.on('agent_alert_new_chat', (session) => {
            const existingIdx = activeChats.findIndex(c => c._id === session._id);
            if (existingIdx !== -1) {
                activeChats[existingIdx] = session;
            } else {
                activeChats.unshift(session);
            }
            renderChatList();
            try {
                new Audio('https://actions.google.com/sounds/v1/alarms/beep_short.ogg').play().catch(e => {});
            } catch (err) {}
        });

        // 6. Receive Live Messages
        socket.on('agent_receive_message', (data) => {
            const { sessionId, message } = data;
            const chat = activeChats.find(c => c._id === sessionId);
            if (chat) {
                chat.messages.push(message);
                if (currentSessionId === sessionId) {
                    appendMessage(message);
                } else {
                    renderChatList();
                }
            }
        });

        // 7. Another agent claimed or updated
        socket.on('agent_chat_updated', (session) => {
            if (session.status === 'bot') {
                activeChats = activeChats.filter(c => String(c._id) !== String(session._id));
                if (String(currentSessionId) === String(session._id)) {
                    closeMobileChat();
                } else {
                    renderChatList();
                }
                return;
            }
            const index = activeChats.findIndex(c => c._id === session._id);
            if (index !== -1) {
                activeChats[index] = session;
            } else {
                activeChats.unshift(session);
            }
            renderChatList();
            if (currentSessionId === session._id) openChat(session._id);
        });

        socket.on('agent_chat_deleted', ({ sessionId }) => {
            activeChats = activeChats.filter(chat => String(chat._id) !== String(sessionId));
            if (String(currentSessionId) === String(sessionId)) {
                closeMobileChat();
            } else {
                renderChatList();
            }
        });

        // --- UI RENDER FUNCTIONS ---
        function isPriorityChat(chat) {
            if (!chat || !chat.user) return false;
            const role = chat.user.role;
            const isPremium = !!chat.user.isPremium;
            return isPremium || role === 'distributor' || role === 'admin' || role === 'owner';
        }

        function createChatCard(chat, isPriority) {
            const isWaiting = chat.status === 'waiting-for-agent';
            const name = chat.user ? chat.user.username : (chat.guestEmail || 'Guest');
            const lastMsgObj = chat.messages && chat.messages.length > 0 ? chat.messages[chat.messages.length - 1] : null;
            let lastMsg = 'No messages';
            if (lastMsgObj) {
                if (lastMsgObj.text) lastMsg = lastMsgObj.text;
                else if (lastMsgObj.mediaUrls && lastMsgObj.mediaUrls.length > 0) lastMsg = '📎 [Attachment]';
            }

            let badgeHtml = '';
            if (chat.user) {
                if (chat.user.role === 'distributor') {
                    badgeHtml = '<span class="user-tag-badge tag-distributor"><i class="fas fa-truck-loading"></i> Distributor</span>';
                } else if (chat.user.isPremium) {
                    badgeHtml = '<span class="user-tag-badge tag-priority"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i> Premium</span>';
                } else if (chat.user.role === 'admin' || chat.user.role === 'owner') {
                    badgeHtml = '<span class="user-tag-badge tag-priority"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Staff</span>';
                }
            }

            const div = document.createElement('div');
            div.className = `chat-item ${isPriority ? 'priority-item' : ''} ${currentSessionId === chat._id ? 'active' : ''}`;
            div.onclick = () => openChat(chat._id);
            div.innerHTML = `
                <span class="status ${isWaiting ? 'waiting' : 'active'}">${isWaiting ? 'Waiting' : 'Assigned'}</span>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                    <strong style="color: ${isPriority ? 'var(--gold)' : 'var(--white)'}; font-size: 0.95em;">${name}</strong>
                    ${badgeHtml}
                </div>
                <div style="color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.82em; margin-top: 5px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">
                    ${lastMsg}
                </div>
            `;
            return div;
        }

        function renderChatList() {
            chatListEl.innerHTML = '';
            if (activeChats.length === 0) {
                chatListEl.innerHTML = '<div style="color: var(--silver); text-align: center; padding: 25px; font-size: 0.85em;">No active conversations</div>';
                return;
            }

            const priorityChats = activeChats.filter(isPriorityChat);
            const standardChats = activeChats.filter(c => !isPriorityChat(c));

            if (priorityChats.length > 0) {
                const priSec = document.createElement('div');
                priSec.className = 'queue-section-header priority';
                priSec.innerHTML = `<span><i class="fas fa-crown" style="margin-right: 5px;"></i> Priority Queue (VIP / Distributors)</span><span class="queue-count priority">${priorityChats.length}</span>`;
                chatListEl.appendChild(priSec);
                priorityChats.forEach(chat => chatListEl.appendChild(createChatCard(chat, true)));
            }

            if (standardChats.length > 0) {
                const stdSec = document.createElement('div');
                stdSec.className = 'queue-section-header standard';
                stdSec.innerHTML = `<span><i class="fas fa-comments" style="margin-right: 5px;"></i> Standard Queue</span><span class="queue-count standard">${standardChats.length}</span>`;
                chatListEl.appendChild(stdSec);
                standardChats.forEach(chat => chatListEl.appendChild(createChatCard(chat, false)));
            }
        }

        function toggleAiDebugger() {
            const card = document.getElementById('aiDebuggerCard');
            if (card) card.classList.toggle('collapsed');
        }

        function toggleStaffEmailCard() {
            const card = document.getElementById('staffEmailCard');
            if (card) card.classList.toggle('collapsed');
        }

        function copyStaffEmail(text, btn) {
            if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
                navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
                    const orig = btn.innerHTML;
                    btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check" style="color: var(--green);"></i>';
                    setTimeout(() => { btn.innerHTML = orig; }, 1500);
                }).catch(() => {
                    prompt("Copy email address:", text);
                });
            } else {
                prompt("Copy email address:", text);
            }
        }

        function closeMobileChat() {
            document.body.classList.remove('chat-view-active');
            currentSessionId = null;
            if (window.innerWidth <= 768) {
                mainChatEl.style.display = 'none';
                emptyStateEl.style.display = 'none';
            } else {
                mainChatEl.style.display = 'none';
                emptyStateEl.style.display = 'flex';
            }
            renderChatList();
        }

        // Auto-collapse diagnostics and staff email cards on mobile screens by default
        if (window.innerWidth <= 768) {
            const card = document.getElementById('aiDebuggerCard');
            if (card) card.classList.add('collapsed');
            const emailCard = document.getElementById('staffEmailCard');
            if (emailCard) emailCard.classList.add('collapsed');
        }

        function renderMediaPreviewTray() {
            if (!deskMediaTray) return;
            if (pendingUploadedMedia.length === 0) {
                deskMediaTray.style.display = 'none';
                deskMediaTray.innerHTML = '';
                return;
            }
            deskMediaTray.style.display = 'flex';
            deskMediaTray.innerHTML = '';
            pendingUploadedMedia.forEach((url, idx) => {
                const item = document.createElement('div');
                item.className = 'media-tray-item';
                const isVid = /\.(mp4|webm|mov|ogg)(\?|$)/i.test(url);
                item.innerHTML = `
                    <i class="${isVid ? 'fas fa-film' : 'fas fa-image'}"></i>
                    <span>Attachment ${idx + 1}</span>
                    <button type="button" class="remove-media-btn" title="Remove attachment">&times;</button>
                `;
                item.querySelector('.remove-media-btn').onclick = () => {
                    pendingUploadedMedia.splice(idx, 1);
                    renderMediaPreviewTray();
                };
                deskMediaTray.appendChild(item);
            });
        }

        function openChat(id) {
            currentSessionId = id;
            const chat = activeChats.find(c => c._id === id);
            if (!chat) return;
            
            pendingUploadedMedia = [];
            renderMediaPreviewTray();
            if (deskEmojiPopover) deskEmojiPopover.style.display = 'none';

            document.body.classList.add('chat-view-active');
            emptyStateEl.style.display = 'none';
            mainChatEl.style.display = 'flex';
            
            chatHeaderName.textContent = chat.user ? chat.user.username : (chat.guestEmail || 'Guest');
            chatHeaderInfo.textContent = (chat.adminNotes ? chat.adminNotes + ' | ' : '') + (chat.guestEmail ? 'Email: ' + chat.guestEmail : (chat.user ? (chat.user.customEmailAlias ? 'Custom Email Address: ' + chat.user.customEmailAlias + '@gplmods.webredirect.org | Email: ' + chat.user.email : 'Email: ' + chat.user.email) : 'No email'));

            // Handle 'Email Customer' direct action button
            const emailCustomerBtn = document.getElementById('emailCustomerBtn');
            const customerEmail = chat.guestEmail || (chat.user && chat.user.email);
            if (emailCustomerBtn) {
                if (customerEmail) {
                    emailCustomerBtn.style.display = 'inline-flex';
                    const customerName = chat.user ? chat.user.username : 'Customer';
                    const ticketId = chat._id ? chat._id.toString().slice(-6).toUpperCase() : 'INQUIRY';
                    const subject = encodeURIComponent(`GPL Mods Support - Ticket #${ticketId}`);
                    const body = encodeURIComponent(`Hi ${customerName},\n\nThis is ${agentName} from the GPL Mods Support Team.\n\nRegarding your ticket #${ticketId}:\n\n\n\n---\nBest regards,\n${agentName}\nGPL Mods Official Support\nhttps://gplmods.webredirect.org`);
                    emailCustomerBtn.href = `mailto:${encodeURIComponent(customerEmail)}?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
                } else {
                    emailCustomerBtn.style.display = 'none';
                }
            }
            
            chatMessagesEl.innerHTML = '';
            chat.messages.forEach(msg => appendMessage(msg));

            if (chat.status === 'waiting-for-agent') {
                claimBtn.style.display = 'block';
                agentInput.disabled = true;
                agentSubmit.disabled = true;
                if (deskEmojiToggleBtn) deskEmojiToggleBtn.disabled = true;
                if (deskMediaUploadBtn) deskMediaUploadBtn.disabled = true;
                agentInput.placeholder = "Claim chat to reply...";
            } else {
                claimBtn.style.display = 'none';
                agentInput.disabled = false;
                agentSubmit.disabled = false;
                if (deskEmojiToggleBtn) deskEmojiToggleBtn.disabled = false;
                if (deskMediaUploadBtn) deskMediaUploadBtn.disabled = false;
                agentInput.placeholder = "Type your reply...";
                agentInput.focus();
            }

            const transferToGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('transferToGeminiBtn');
            if (transferToGeminiBtn) {
                if (chat.status === 'active-agent' || chat.status === 'waiting-for-agent') {
                    transferToGeminiBtn.style.display = 'inline-flex';
                } else {
                    transferToGeminiBtn.style.display = 'none';
                }
            }

            renderChatList();
        }

        function appendMessage(msg) {
            const div = document.createElement('div');
            let typeClass = 'msg-system';
            if (msg.sender === 'user') typeClass = 'msg-user';
            if (msg.sender === 'agent') typeClass = 'msg-agent';
            if (msg.sender === 'bot') typeClass = 'msg-bot';
            
            div.className = `msg-bubble ${typeClass}`;

            let mediaHtml = '';
            if (Array.isArray(msg.mediaUrls) && msg.mediaUrls.length > 0) {
                mediaHtml = '<div class="msg-media-container" style="margin-top: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">';
                msg.mediaUrls.forEach(url => {
                    const isVid = /\.(mp4|webm|mov|ogg)(\?|$)/i.test(url);
                    if (isVid) {
                        mediaHtml += `<video controls src="${url}" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 280px; border-radius: 8px; background: #000;" preload="metadata"></video>`;
                    } else {
                        mediaHtml += `<a href="${url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="${url}" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 280px; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: contain; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'" alt="Attachment" /></a>`;
                    }
                });
                mediaHtml += '</div>';
            }

            div.innerHTML = `
                ${msg.sender === 'agent' || msg.sender === 'bot' ? `<strong style="font-size:0.8em; opacity:0.8; display:block; margin-bottom:3px;">${msg.senderName || msg.sender}</strong>` : ''}
                ${msg.text ? `<div>${(msg.text || '').replace(/\n/g, '<br>')}</div>` : ''}
                ${mediaHtml}
            `;
            chatMessagesEl.appendChild(div);
            chatMessagesEl.scrollTop = chatMessagesEl.scrollHeight;
        }

        // --- EMOJI PICKER POPULATION & CONTROLS ---
        const EMOJI_LIST = [
            "👍", "👎", "❤️", "😊", "😂", "🎉", "🔥", "🚀", 
            "💡", "⚠️", "❌", "✔️", "💻", "📱", "📦", "⚡", 
            "🙌", "👋", "🙏", "😎", "🥳", "🤔", "👀", "✨", 
            "💯", "🔒", "🔑", "🛠️", "⚙️", "📎", "📩", "⭐"
        ];

        if (deskEmojiGrid) {
            EMOJI_LIST.forEach(emoji => {
                const span = document.createElement('span');
                span.className = 'emoji-item';
                span.textContent = emoji;
                span.onclick = () => {
                    insertEmojiAtCursor(emoji);
                    if (deskEmojiPopover) deskEmojiPopover.style.display = 'none';
                };
                deskEmojiGrid.appendChild(span);
            });
        }

        function insertEmojiAtCursor(emoji) {
            if (!agentInput) return;
            const start = agentInput.selectionStart || 0;
            const end = agentInput.selectionEnd || 0;
            const val = agentInput.value;
            agentInput.value = val.substring(0, start) + emoji + val.substring(end);
            agentInput.selectionStart = agentInput.selectionEnd = start + emoji.length;
            agentInput.focus();
        }

        if (deskEmojiToggleBtn) {
            deskEmojiToggleBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                e.stopPropagation();
                if (deskEmojiToggleBtn.disabled) return;
                const isVisible = deskEmojiPopover.style.display === 'block';
                deskEmojiPopover.style.display = isVisible ? 'none' : 'block';
            });
        }

        if (closeDeskEmojiBtn) {
            closeDeskEmojiBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                if (deskEmojiPopover) deskEmojiPopover.style.display = 'none';
            });
        }

        document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (deskEmojiPopover && !deskEmojiPopover.contains(e.target) && e.target !== deskEmojiToggleBtn && (!deskEmojiToggleBtn || !deskEmojiToggleBtn.contains(e.target))) {
                deskEmojiPopover.style.display = 'none';
            }
        });

        // --- MEDIA UPLOAD HANDLERS ---
        if (deskMediaUploadBtn && deskMediaInput) {
            deskMediaUploadBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                if (!currentSessionId || deskMediaUploadBtn.disabled) return;
                deskMediaInput.click();
            });

            deskMediaInput.addEventListener('change', async () => {
                const file = deskMediaInput.files[0];
                if (!file) return;
                if (file.size > 25 * 1024 * 1024) {
                    alert('File is too large. Maximum allowed size is 25MB.');
                    deskMediaInput.value = '';
                    return;
                }

                if (deskMediaTray) {
                    deskMediaTray.style.display = 'flex';
                    deskMediaTray.innerHTML = '<span style="color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.85em;"><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Uploading attachment...</span>';
                }

                const formData = new FormData();
                formData.append('media', file);

                try {
                    const res = await fetch('/api/support/upload-media', {
                        method: 'POST',
                        body: formData
                    });
                    const data = await res.json();
                    deskMediaInput.value = '';
                    if (data.success && data.url) {
                        pendingUploadedMedia.push(data.url);
                        renderMediaPreviewTray();
                    } else {
                        alert(data.message || 'Media upload failed.');
                        renderMediaPreviewTray();
                    }
                } catch (e) {
                    deskMediaInput.value = '';
                    alert('Failed to upload media.');
                    renderMediaPreviewTray();
                }
            });
        }

        // --- ACTION HANDLERS ---
        claimBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            socket.emit('agent_claim_chat', { sessionId: currentSessionId, agentId, agentName });
        });

        const deskGeminiTransferModal = document.getElementById('deskGeminiTransferModal');
        const cancelDeskGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('cancelDeskGeminiBtn');
        const confirmDeskGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('confirmDeskGeminiBtn');

        function closeDeskGeminiModal() {
            if (deskGeminiTransferModal) {
                deskGeminiTransferModal.style.opacity = '0';
                setTimeout(() => deskGeminiTransferModal.style.display = 'none', 200);
            }
        }

        if (transferToGeminiBtn) {
            transferToGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                if (!currentSessionId) return;
                if (deskGeminiTransferModal) {
                    deskGeminiTransferModal.style.display = 'flex';
                    requestAnimationFrame(() => deskGeminiTransferModal.style.opacity = '1');
                }
            });
        }

        if (cancelDeskGeminiBtn) cancelDeskGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', closeDeskGeminiModal);
        if (confirmDeskGeminiBtn) {
            confirmDeskGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                if (!currentSessionId) return closeDeskGeminiModal();
                const targetId = currentSessionId;
                socket.emit('agent_transfer_to_bot', { sessionId: targetId, agentId });
                closeDeskGeminiModal();
                if (transferToGeminiBtn) transferToGeminiBtn.style.display = 'none';
                activeChats = activeChats.filter(c => String(c._id) !== String(targetId));
                closeMobileChat();
            });
        }

        function closeDeleteChatModal() {
            deleteChatModal.style.opacity = '0';
            setTimeout(() => deleteChatModal.style.display = 'none', 200);
        }
        deleteChatBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!currentSessionId) return;
            deleteChatModal.style.display = 'flex';
            requestAnimationFrame(() => deleteChatModal.style.opacity = '1');
        });
        cancelDeleteChatBtn.addEventListener('click', closeDeleteChatModal);
        confirmDeleteChatBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!currentSessionId) return closeDeleteChatModal();
            const targetId = currentSessionId;
            socket.emit('agent_delete_chat', { sessionId: targetId, agentId });
            closeDeleteChatModal();
            activeChats = activeChats.filter(chat => String(chat._id) !== String(targetId));
            closeMobileChat();
        });

        document.getElementById('agentForm').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            const text = agentInput.value.trim();
            if ((text || pendingUploadedMedia.length > 0) && currentSessionId) {
                socket.emit('agent_send_message', { 
                    sessionId: currentSessionId, 
                    text, 
                    agentName,
                    agentId,
                    mediaUrls: [...pendingUploadedMedia]
                });
                agentInput.value = '';
                pendingUploadedMedia = [];
                renderMediaPreviewTray();
            }
        });

        // ==========================================
        // STAFF WORK EMAIL & SMTP AJAX HANDLERS
        // ==========================================
        const deskClaimForm = document.getElementById('deskClaimEmailForm');
        if (deskClaimForm) {
            deskClaimForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
                e.preventDefault();
                const btn = document.getElementById('deskClaimBtn');
                const feedback = document.getElementById('staffEmailFeedbackBox');
                if (btn) { btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Claiming...'; }
                try {
                    const res = await fetch('/account/claim-custom-email', {
                        method: 'POST',
                        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Accept': 'application/json' },
                        body: JSON.stringify({ redirectUrl: '/admin/support' })
                    });
                    const data = await res.json();
                    if (data.success) {
                        if (feedback) {
                            feedback.style.display = 'block';
                            feedback.style.background = 'rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.15)';
                            feedback.style.border = '1px solid var(--green)';
                            feedback.style.color = '#a3e9b8';
                            feedback.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> ' + (data.message || 'Staff email claimed!') + ' Refreshing...';
                        }
                        setTimeout(() => window.location.reload(), 1200);
                    } else {
                        if (feedback) {
                            feedback.style.display = 'block';
                            feedback.style.background = 'rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15)';
                            feedback.style.border = '1px solid var(--red)';
                            feedback.style.color = '#ffadad';
                            feedback.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> ' + (data.message || 'Failed to claim email.');
                        }
                        if (btn) { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Claim Staff Email'; }
                    }
                } catch (err) {
                    console.error("AJAX claim email error:", err);
                    deskClaimForm.submit();
                }
            });
        }

        const deskSmtpForm = document.getElementById('deskGenSmtpForm');
        if (deskSmtpForm) {
            deskSmtpForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
                e.preventDefault();
                const btn = document.getElementById('deskGenSmtpBtn');
                const feedback = document.getElementById('staffEmailFeedbackBox');
                if (btn) { btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Generating...'; }
                try {
                    const res = await fetch('/account/generate-smtp', {
                        method: 'POST',
                        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Accept': 'application/json' },
                        body: JSON.stringify({ redirectUrl: '/admin/support' })
                    });
                    const data = await res.json();
                    if (data.success) {
                        if (feedback) {
                            feedback.style.display = 'block';
                            feedback.style.background = 'rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.12)';
                            feedback.style.border = '1px solid var(--gold)';
                            feedback.style.color = 'var(--white)';
                            feedback.innerHTML = `
                                <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: bold; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                    <i class="fas fa-key"></i> SMTP Password Generated!
                                </div>
                                <div style="font-size: 0.74em; color: var(--silver); margin-bottom: 6px;">
                                    Copy this now, it will not be displayed again:
                                </div>
                                <div style="background: #000; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.92em; color: #00ff88; user-select: all; word-break: break-all; border: 1px dashed #444;">
                                    ${data.smtpPassword}
                                </div>
                            `;
                        }
                        if (btn) {
                            btn.disabled = false;
                            btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Regenerate Password';
                        }
                    } else {
                        if (feedback) {
                            feedback.style.display = 'block';
                            feedback.style.background = 'rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15)';
                            feedback.style.border = '1px solid var(--red)';
                            feedback.style.color = '#ffadad';
                            feedback.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> ' + (data.message || 'Failed to generate SMTP.');
                        }
                        if (btn) { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-key"></i> Generate SMTP Access'; }
                    }
                } catch (err) {
                    console.error("AJAX generate smtp error:", err);
                    deskSmtpForm.submit();
                }
            });
        }

        // ==========================================
        // GEMINI VISIBILITY CONFIGURATION MODAL LOGIC
        // ==========================================
        const geminiModal = document.getElementById('geminiVisibilityModal');
        const openGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('openGeminiModalBtn');
        const closeGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('closeGeminiModalBtn');
        const cancelGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('cancelGeminiModalBtn');
        const saveGeminiBtn = document.getElementById('saveGeminiConfigBtn');
        const geminiMasterToggle = document.getElementById('geminiMasterToggle');
        const newSlugInput = document.getElementById('newSlugInput');
        const addSlugBtn = document.getElementById('addSlugBtn');
        const slugListContainer = document.getElementById('slugListContainer');
        const slugCount = document.getElementById('slugCount');
        const feedbackEl = document.getElementById('geminiModalFeedback');

        let currentHiddenPages = [];

        function renderSlugs() {
            slugListContainer.innerHTML = '';
            slugCount.textContent = currentHiddenPages.length;
            if (currentHiddenPages.length === 0) {
                slugListContainer.innerHTML = '<span style="color:#666; font-size:0.75em; padding:4px;">No pages restricted. Gemini will show on all pages.</span>';
                return;
            }
            currentHiddenPages.forEach((slug, idx) => {
                const pill = document.createElement('span');
                pill.style.cssText = 'display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:#222; border:1px solid #444; border-radius:14px; padding:3px 10px; font-size:0.78em; color:#e0e0e0;';
                pill.innerHTML = `<code>${slug}</code> <i class="fas fa-times" style="cursor:pointer; color:#ff6b6b;" title="Remove"></i>`;
                pill.querySelector('i').addEventListener('click', () => {
                    currentHiddenPages.splice(idx, 1);
                    renderSlugs();
                });
                slugListContainer.appendChild(pill);
            });
        }

        function addSlugFromInput() {
            const val = newSlugInput.value.trim();
            if (!val) return;
            if (!currentHiddenPages.includes(val)) {
                currentHiddenPages.push(val);
                renderSlugs();
            }
            newSlugInput.value = '';
        }

        addSlugBtn.addEventListener('click', addSlugFromInput);
        newSlugInput.addEventListener('keypress', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'Enter') {
                e.preventDefault();
                addSlugFromInput();
            }
        });

        async function loadGeminiConfig() {
            try {
                const res = await fetch('/api/admin/gemini-config');
                const data = await res.json();
                if (data.success) {
                    geminiMasterToggle.checked = data.enableGeminiChatbot;
                    currentHiddenPages = data.geminiHiddenPages || [];
                    renderSlugs();
                }
            } catch (err) {
                console.error("Error loading Gemini config:", err);
            }
        }

        function openGeminiModal() {
            geminiModal.style.display = 'flex';
            feedbackEl.style.display = 'none';
            loadGeminiConfig();
        }

        function closeGeminiModal() {
            geminiModal.style.display = 'none';
        }

        openGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', openGeminiModal);
        closeGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', closeGeminiModal);
        cancelGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', closeGeminiModal);

        saveGeminiBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
            saveGeminiBtn.disabled = true;
            saveGeminiBtn.textContent = 'Saving...';
            try {
                const res = await fetch('/api/admin/gemini-config', {
                    method: 'POST',
                    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                    body: JSON.stringify({
                        enableGeminiChatbot: geminiMasterToggle.checked,
                        geminiHiddenPages: currentHiddenPages
                    })
                });
                const data = await res.json();
                saveGeminiBtn.disabled = false;
                saveGeminiBtn.textContent = 'Save Settings';
                if (data.success) {
                    feedbackEl.style.display = 'block';
                    feedbackEl.style.color = 'var(--green)';
                    feedbackEl.textContent = '✔ Settings saved! Changes are now live.';
                    setTimeout(closeGeminiModal, 1500);
                } else {
                    feedbackEl.style.display = 'block';
                    feedbackEl.style.color = 'var(--red)';
                    feedbackEl.textContent = '✖ Failed: ' + (data.error || 'Unknown error');
                }
            } catch (err) {
                saveGeminiBtn.disabled = false;
                saveGeminiBtn.textContent = 'Save Settings';
                feedbackEl.style.display = 'block';
                feedbackEl.style.color = 'var(--red)';
                feedbackEl.textContent = '✖ Network error: ' + err.message;
            }
        });
    </script>

    <!-- ======== GEMINI VISIBILITY CONFIGURATION MODAL ======== -->
    <div id="geminiVisibilityModal" style="display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75); z-index: 99999; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;">
        <div style="background: #181818; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 520px; width: 100%; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); position: relative;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding-bottom: 12px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.25em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Gemini Visibility Settings
                </h3>
                <button type="button" id="closeGeminiModalBtn" style="background: none; border: none; color: var(--silver); font-size: 1.4em; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
                <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95em;">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="geminiMasterToggle" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--gold); cursor: pointer;" checked>
                    <span>Enable Gemini Chatbot on Website</span>
                </label>
                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 28px; font-size: 0.78em; color: var(--silver);">
                    When checked, Gemini will show on all pages by default, except the paths specified below.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 6px;">
                    Hide on Specific Pages / URL Slugs:
                </label>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;">
                    <input type="text" id="newSlugInput" placeholder="e.g. mods/:id, /admin, /upload" style="flex: 1; padding: 9px 12px; background: #0d0d0d; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9em; outline: none;">
                    <button type="button" id="addSlugBtn" style="padding: 9px 16px; background: var(--gold); color: #000; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;">Add</button>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.75em; color: #888; margin-top: 6px;">
                    Supported formats: <code>/upload</code>, <code>mods/:id</code>, <code>/admin/*</code>, <code>/status</code>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- List of hidden slugs -->
            <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--silver); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">Currently Hidden Pages (<span id="slugCount">0</span>):</div>
                <div id="slugListContainer" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; max-height: 140px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px; background: #101010; border: 1px solid #282828; border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px;">
                    <!-- Slugs rendered here -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding-top: 14px;">
                <button type="button" id="cancelGeminiModalBtn" style="padding: 8px 16px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #444; color: #ccc; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85em;">Cancel</button>
                <button type="button" id="saveGeminiConfigBtn" style="padding: 8px 18px; background: var(--gold); border: none; color: #000; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85em;">Save Settings</button>
            </div>
            <div id="geminiModalFeedback" style="display: none; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.8em; text-align: center; color: var(--green);"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======== AGENT TRANSFER TO GEMINI CONFIRMATION MODAL ======== -->
    <div id="deskGeminiTransferModal" style="display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); z-index: 99999; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; transition: opacity 0.2s ease;">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a1e28 0%, #12141c 50%, #0c0d12 100%); border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.45); border-radius: 14px; max-width: 460px; width: 100%; padding: 28px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.85), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.25); text-align: center; position: relative;">
            <div style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.12); border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.35);">
                <img src="/images/gemini.png" alt="Gemini" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; object-fit: contain;">
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1.25em; font-weight: 700;">Transfer to Gemini Chatbot?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--silver); font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">
                Mark this support issue as resolved and hand the conversation back over to the <strong>Gemini AI Assistant</strong>? The user will be notified in real-time and can continue chatting with the AI.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;">
                <button type="button" id="cancelDeskGeminiBtn" style="padding: 10px 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1.5px solid #3d4250; color: #ccc; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;">
                    Cancel
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="confirmDeskGeminiBtn" style="padding: 10px 24px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e676 0%, #00b0ff 100%); border: none; color: #000; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.45); transition: all 0.2s;">
                    <i class="fas fa-robot" style="margin-right: 6px;"></i> Yes, Transfer to Gemini
